Exercise: AI Product Owner for Spring Boot Developers
Objective

Create a Spring Boot REST API where the AI (using LangChain4j and an OpenAI model) acts as a Product Owner.

The AI should:

Decide a project topic as given by the user in the prompt.
Generate API requirements.
Suggest database tables.
List endpoints.
Generate sample JSON.
The developer then implements the APIs.








Exercise: AI Product Owner for React.js Developers
Objective

Create a React.js application where the project topic, UI requirements, and API contract are generated by an LLM (via LangChain4j and OpenAI).

The React developer must:

Understand the AI-generated requirements.
Build the user interface.
Consume the generated REST APIs.
Handle validation and errors.
Make the application responsive.
Tech Stack
React 19
Vite
JavaScript or TypeScript
Axios or Fetch API
React Router
Context API or Redux Toolkit
Tailwind CSS or Bootstrap
LangChain4j
OpenAI API

